&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;EssenceMediacom is a new breed of media agency and one of the leading brands of WPP Media. Grounded in analysis and insight, and driven by data and technology, we believe in the power of media and creativity to help the world&#39;s best brands break through. We are built for the new communications economy – for people and algorithms, with diverse mindsets to test and learn at scale, and, above all, to evolve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer you:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life Balance:&lt;/strong&gt; Thanks to flexible working hours with a focus on in-person collaboration at the office, complemented by remote work options, your job adapts to your life. You can also compensate for overtime.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vacation Mode On:&lt;/strong&gt; You receive 30 vacation days plus one flexible day – in addition, the 24th and 31st of December are free.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing First:&lt;/strong&gt; Health benefits, attractive retirement plans, and Mental Health Awareness Days put your health at the center.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice Makes Perfect:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop yourself with our diverse training opportunities and use our internal career programs for your development within the WPP network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More Than Just a Job:&lt;/strong&gt; You can expect unforgettable events, employee discounts, and other highlights such as the Job Ticket, Wellhub, or the Job Bike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be Yourself:&lt;/strong&gt; Everyone is welcome here - diversity and equal opportunities are important to us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is what you move:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As &lt;strong&gt;Group Head Paid Social&lt;/strong&gt;, you will lead the strategic direction and high-level delivery of cross-market campaigns for our global key account &lt;strong&gt;Google&lt;/strong&gt;, serving as the primary strategic interface between senior clients, platform partners, and internal specialist teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Account Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Owning the overarching paid social roadmap for Google workstreams, ensuring all campaign strategies perfectly align with business KPIs, measurement priorities, and agency-wide best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Building and nurturing high-level relationships with key client stakeholders, platform partners (Meta, TikTok, LinkedIn, Snap, Pinterest), and internal leadership teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process &amp;amp; Workflow Governance:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Driving operational excellence by identifying and implementing improvements in paid social processes, briefing standards, and campaign workflows across all markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Client Advisory:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Acting as an expert partner to internal teams, media and marketing teams on client side to challenge briefs, refine objectives, and guide stakeholders toward the most impactful media approaches.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation &amp;amp; Testing Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Directing the development of advanced testing plans and pro-actively identifying industry trends, alpha/beta product releases, and growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regional Quality Assurance:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Taking ultimate accountability for channel controls, campaign compliance, and leading the regional development of paid social standards within your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The following qualities distinguish you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Agency Background:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Extensive (4–6 years) hands-on digital agency experience managing multi-million dollar paid social campaigns across the EMEA region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Social Platform Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;In-depth, expert-level knowledge of Meta, TikTok, LinkedIn, Snap, and Pinterest, ideally backed by industry credentials (e.g., Meta Blueprint Certified).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bilingual Communication Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Professional-level fluency in English (written and spoken) is mandatory to confidently lead daily communication across diverse, global teams and senior client structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong analytical skills with a natural affinity for numbers and the ability to extract actionable strategic insights from complex, raw data sets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translational Capability:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Outstanding interpersonal skills and the unique ability to act as a bridge, translating highly technical platform data into simplified, high-level strategic advice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AdTech &amp;amp; Automation Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of programmatic optimization levers, ideally complemented by experience with third-party tools like Smartly.io or Sprinklr.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Furthermore you are:&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;#strategic #analytical #collaborative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this job sounds exciting to you, we strongly encourage you to apply, even if you don&#39;t have every qualification listed above.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
