&lt;p&gt;The Director, Thought Leadership is responsible for developing and executing the thought leadership strategy for WPP Data &amp;amp; Technology Solutions. The role will identify the issues on which WPP can credibly lead the market, develop distinctive perspectives and proprietary content, and translate complex developments across AI, data, technology and marketing into clear, influential narratives. This individual will lead the creation of flagship research, executive platforms, reports, articles, keynote narratives and event programming that strengthen WPP’s reputation, deepen client engagement and support commercial growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
