&lt;li&gt;Drive a risk-based approach to emerging challenges including AI misuse, prompt abuse and data protection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Trust &amp;amp; Security Assurance:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
