&lt;li&gt;Contribute to platform resilience, continuity planning and recovery readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with cyber incident response teams on security events, investigations and risk management activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define and communicate security metrics, risk indicators and platform security trends to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
